conclusions:
with probability at least
$1-\delta$ over the draws of $\mathcal{S}_{\mathrm{cond}}(x)$ and $\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{G}}$,
\[
\bigl|\widehat{\mathcal{L}}_\phi(x) - \mathcal{L}(x)\bigr|
\;\le\;
K_{\max}\sqrt{8\,\log(2/\delta)\!\left(\tfrac{1}{n_{\mathrm{cond}}}+\tfrac{1}{n_{\mathrm{target}}}\right)}
\;+\;
C_2\,\varepsilon_s,
\]
