 \;\le\; \|d\varphi_k(f_\phi(x,\eta)) - d\varphi_k(f_{\mathrm{true}}(x,\eta))\|_{\mathrm{op}}
   \cdot \|\partial_x f_{\mathrm{true}}(x,\eta)\|_F.
\]
By Assumption~\ref{ass:kernel}(iii), $d\varphi_k$ is $H_k$-Lipschitz, so
